a great  episode like I said I really like the  emergence of the FBI and the  contradiction between the FBI and the  small-town Sheriff's Department pretty  sure this is when I decided that Ben  Horne was just creepy and I didn't enjoy  his character I mean I enjoy it watching  him but he's just not a good person  Audrey obviously set up her place as  being a very captivating character  throughout and James and Donna just  started to get on my nerves and I think  a little bit with Mike and Bobby too  because of they're not bad characters  it's just they're playing high school  jocks who sell drugs and you know what I  mean like they're not likable but I do  think that on the rewatch I realized a  little bit more about how that whole  exchange was Shelley and Bobby how there  was something real there in how he  wanted to protect her from leo so that's  all I'm gonna say about this right now  we'll definitely talk more about the red  and all of that as this goes on it's one  of my favorite episodes still although I  think that the first three really  together is the genesis you know what I  mean like I don't know that this stands  out  obviously the pilot is good in a  different way the second episode sets a  lot of things up and then this one takes  us in a different direction so it would  be really hard to say that one of these  would stand out as essential I mean as a  trio they're really all pretty essential  as far as I'm concerned so let me know  what you guys think in the comments  thanks to my patreon patrons for making  this happen sorry this took a little bit  longer but I'll be continuing on with  the rest of the season think about  joining us over there I've been really  the I've been really obsessed with the  final dossier and just thinking about  that and I want to make some more videos  about that as well but I will this is  what you guys voted on and this is what  I will so make sure you subscribe if you  haven't already make sure you turn on  notifications after you do that follow  me on Twitter and my other social media  accounts thanks for watching guys I'll  talk to you soon
 

